Client sends request
        ↓
FastAPI matches the route
        ↓
FastAPI extracts the inputs
        ↓
FastAPI parses and validates them
        ↓
        ├── VALID
        │      ↓
        │  Endpoint function runs
        │      ↓
        │  Your business logic runs
        │      ↓
        │  Response sent to client
        │
        └── INVALID
               ↓
           Endpoint function is skipped
               ↓
           FastAPI creates a validation error response
               ↓
           Error response sent to client/frontend




